        "answer": {
          "short": "$P$ is directly proportional to $Q$.",
          "worked": "The symbol $\\propto$ means “is directly proportional to”. Therefore, $P$ is directly proportional to $Q$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p12-q5-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\ell\\propto m^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\ell$ is directly proportional to the square of $m$.",
          "worked": "Read $m^2$ as “the square of $m$” and $\\propto$ as “is directly proportional to”. Therefore, $\\ell$ is directly proportional to the square of $m$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p12-q5-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$a^2\\propto\\sqrt{b}$",
